{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……那麼，大家請保重。』", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 197, "voice": "rk0708", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『我會期待再相見的那天。』", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 197, "voice": "rk0709", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隨著學園長道別的話語，合併試辦結束了。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾脆到令人有些意外，而且……留下深遠的餘韻。", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……結束後再來看，真的很短呢。」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 202, "voice": "ht1216", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "合併試辦開始到現在，兩個月。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "現在回頭看，真是一轉眼就過去了。", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "發生了很多事呢。", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "開心的事、難過的事、悲傷的事。", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，在這裡度過的時間成為了對我來說是很重要的回憶。", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的已經結束了嗎？」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 193, "voice": "sk4001", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊……還沒有真實感呢。」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 189, "voice": "ar5656", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，安潔也是。」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 188, "voice": "ag3627", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺假日結束後還能再跟大家見面。」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 188, "voice": "ag3628", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我倒是覺得回到沒有男人的安靜生活很高興。」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 196, "voice": "sn2224", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "連熟悉的毒舌都沒有了氣勢。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君你們等一下要做什麼？」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 189, "voice": "ar5657", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們到今天就結束了，所以為了表達感謝兼整理物品，待會要打掃我們使用的地方。」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 189, "voice": "ar5658", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打掃的話，安潔也來幫忙！」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 188, "voice": "ag3629", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝妳，不過……今天可以就交給各務台的男生們嗎？」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是呢，那麼，麻煩各位了。」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 188, "voice": "ag3630", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個……是學校的鑰匙。」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 188, "voice": "ag3631", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我接下她遞來的鑰匙。", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是……？」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為打掃時需要。」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 188, "voice": "ag3632", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是啊。」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這是安潔信賴的證明。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我可以暫時借用一下嗎？」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然了。」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 188, "voice": "ag3633", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔有備用的所以不必擔心。全部都結束後再還給安潔。」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 188, "voice": "ag3634", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝妳，安潔。」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 191, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
